            "title": "港股午後進一步收復失地 恒指曾倒升逾10點",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股午後向收復失地邁進，恒生指數稍早前最高曾見22,424點，倒升13點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">截至下午約2時04分，恒指微升2點，報22,413點；恒生科技指數升12點或0.35%，報3,523點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">聯想(00992)午後升勢擴大，暫漲逾7.6%。阿里巴巴(09988)暫倒升0.12%，報83.45元；滙控(00005)升幅稍微擴大至0.54%，報129.9元。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17244098-%e6%b8%af%e8%82%a1%e5%8d%88%e5%be%8c%e9%80%b2%e4%b8%80%e6%ad%a5%e6%94%b6%e5%be%a9%e5%a4%b1%e5%9c%b0-%e6%81%92%e6%8c%87%e6%9b%be%e5%80%92%e5%8d%87%e9%80%be10%e9%bb%9e",
